  "summary": "Aspocomp Group Oyj manufactures and sells printed circuit boards (PCBs) in Finland, Europe, and internationally. The company offers high speed digital, advanced high density interconnection, high layer count multilayer, heavy copper, and high frequency PCBs, as well as PCBs with component cooling for thermal management. It also provides quick turn around, design support, logistics, and global supply services. The company's products are used in various applications in automotive, semiconductor industry, telecommunication, industrial electronics, security, and defense and aerospace sectors. Aspocomp Group Oyj was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Espoo, Finland.",
